/* ESP32-WROOM-DA: indoor BMP280 SDA21/SCL22; outdoor DHT22 DATA32.
Relays: 26/33 active LOW. INA219 shares the BMP280 bus. Pressure is station pressure, hPa.
Select ESP32-WROOM-DA Module, 4MB, PSRAM disabled, OTA partition.
*/
/*
  HOME ASSISTANT ESP32 - PRIMO NA TABLETU, JEDEN SOUBOR
  Web je ulozen v ESP32. Na tabletu otevrete http://IP-ESP32/.
  Pocitac ani samostatny webovy server nejsou pro provoz potreba.
  Rele 1 GPIO26: svetlo pod troubou; rele 2 GPIO33: volne.
  ACTIVE LOW, pri startu vypnute. Bez garaze. Railway + plny lokalni panel.
  BMP280 uvnitr SDA21/SCL22; DHT22 venku DATA32; INA219 SDA21/SCL22.
  Panel se otevre rovnou bez prihlasovaciho hesla.
  Wi-Fi, API a OTA pristupy jsou take primo v tomto souboru.
  Knihovny: ArduinoJson 7.4.3, DHT sensor library 1.4.7, Adafruit BMP280 Library 2.6.8,
  Adafruit Unified Sensor 1.1.15, INA219 1.2.3, BusIO 1.17.4.
  ESP32-WROOM-DA Module, core Espressif 3.3.8, 4 MB, OTA oddily.
  Zadny dalsi soubor .h/.cpp/HTML pro nahrani neni potreba.
  Cloud pouziva overene HTTPS; lokalni panel zustava dostupny bez internetu.
*/

